{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 25, :comments ["<b>If you take a pledge, you shall take.</b> The Holy One, blessed be He, says: What — you owe Me and he owes you? If you act toward him properly, your soul, which ascends before Me every evening to give account, I will return it to you. And if you do not return his pledge, I too will not return your soul, which is your pledge."], :book :exodus, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 22, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:03:54.705582273Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}